//! task: write
//! ask: Widen a u8 to a u32.
//! expect: ok
//! refs: §5.4, §8.6
//! explain: There is no implicit widening. The conversion is explicit with `sicut Type` (the cast sits at precedence level 3, tighter than `*`). Without it, `redde x;` where u32 is expected is EXS-E0303.

publica functio amplia(x: u8) -> u32 {
    redde x sicut u32;
}
